# Frontend

## Templates
- All templates extend `base.html`.
- Use `{% block content %}` for page-specific content.
- No inline `<style>` or `<script>` tags — use `app/static/` files.
- Use Bootstrap 5 utility classes before custom CSS.

## UI Routes
- UI routes use `prefix="/ui"` and `include_in_schema=False`.
- Use `RedirectResponse` after form POST, never render directly.

## Status badges
- pending → bg-secondary, processing → bg-info, ready → bg-success, failed → bg-danger
